K2 Horizon 32B
Original model: IFM / MBZUAI, https://huggingface.co/IFM/K2-Horizon-32B
The upstream model card declares Apache-2.0 licensing.

JuliaVision distributes a traced inference graph and a half-precision export
of the original weights. The safetensors export is partitioned into shards
without changing the exported tensor bytes. Tokenizer files accompany the graph.
The tiny test artifact contains random weights and PyTorch reference outputs.
